          "description": "Welcome to LiteRight Academy by LITELAB. We are an independent lighting design consultancy that specializes in sustainable lighting, home automation, and IoT solutions.",
          "content": "<section class=\"lesson-section\"><h3>Welcome to LITELAB</h3><p>Welcome to LiteRight Academy by LITELAB. We are an independent lighting design consultancy that specializes in sustainable lighting, home automation, and IoT solutions. In this course, we're sharing the collective wisdom of over 20 years of experience in the lighting industry.</p><p>We don't just design lighting; we create synergized environments where technology and aesthetics meet to deliver happiness. Whether it's a small residence or a massive international infrastructure project, our mission remains the same: design excellence and client satisfaction.</p></section>\n<section class=\"lesson-section\"><h3>Our Roots: From Milan to Global Hubs</h3><p>Our story began in 2003 in Milan, Italy. Immersed in the heart of global design, we set out to master the art of light. Since then, we have grown into a multi-national firm with deep roots in India, UAE, and Sri Lanka.</p><p>Starting with our first Indian office in Chennai in 2014, followed by Bengaluru and Hyderabad, we have consistently expanded to stay at the pulse of the fastest-growing design markets in the world.</p></section>\n<section class=\"lesson-section\"><h3>Expansion: UAE & Sri Lanka</h3><p>In 2023, we opened our Dubai office to serve the Middle East's ambitious architectural landscape. Most recently, in 2024, we established a presence in Colombo, Sri Lanka. This global footprint allows us to bring international standards to regional solutions, ensuring we are always where our clients are.</p></section>\n<section class=\"lesson-section\"><h3>Our Team & Synergy</h3><p>Our greatest asset is our synergized team of over 30 designers and engineers. We provide a collaborative environment where designers and industry specialists come together. We stay updated on technological advancements and global trends to ensure every solution we offer is qualitative and innovative.</p></section>\n<section class=\"lesson-section\"><h3>Sustainability & IoT</h3><p>We are pioneers in Sustainable Lighting and IoT integration. Our specialization includes Home Automation and Smart Control systems that prioritize the user's well-being. We focus on Human-Centric Lighting and LEED-rated projects, ensuring that our designs are not just beautiful, but also responsible and forward-thinking.</p></section>\n<section class=\"lesson-section\"><h3>What to Expect</h3><p>In this course, we will walk you through our proprietary 6-step project lifecycle—from initial site analysis to final project handover. You'll gain access to the same methods and standards we use for our high-profile projects in over 5 countries. Let's get started.</p></section>"
